WEBVTT

00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:31.918
Aflotun mast komediyanavis bazmda 
shunday deyishi mumkinligiga ishongan.

00:01:31.918 --> 00:01:34.970
Sevgi sabab bolalar dunyoga keladi.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:38.199
Ko'p yillar o'tgach, 
nemis faylasufi Artur Shopengauer

00:01:38.199 --> 00:01:41.155
jinsiy istakka asoslangan sevgi

00:01:41.155 --> 00:01:43.734
hissiy xom xayol ekanini ta'kidlagan.
Unga ko'ra,

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:47.113
xohishlarimiz bizni birov baxtli 
qilishiga ishonishga undagani bois

00:01:47.113 --> 00:01:52.165
sevib qolamiz, ammo biz qattiq 
yanglishamiz. Tabiat naslimizni

00:01:52.165 --> 00:01:54.330
davom ettirish uchun mug'ambirlik qiladi

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:58.698
va biz izlaydigan ishqiy qovishuv 
farzand ko’rish bilan yakun topadi.

00:01:58.698 --> 00:02:00.662
Jinsiy ehtiyojlarimiz qondirilgach,